{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14896","headline":"晚次新丰北野老家书事呈赠韩质明府 · 卢纶","name":"晚次新丰北野老家书事呈赠韩质明府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"机鸣舂响日暾暾，鸡犬相和汉古村。\n数派清泉黄菊盛，一林寒露紫棃繁。\n衰翁正席矜新社，稚子齐襟读古论。\n共说年来但无事，不知何者是君恩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14896.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14896","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}